## E3 (L5) — The 1987 experiment, on your worst day

Drop your sample's worst day (E1's top). Recompute: mean, SD, kurtosis,
max drawdown, p1. Present with/without. Which statistics are "one
observation deep"?

```python
def max_dd(s):
    w = (1 + s).cumprod()
    return (1 - w / w.cummax()).min()
# YOUR CODE
```

